# Scoped to containers/media-ops/Dockerfile (BuildKit's per-Dockerfile
# ignore file: "<path-to-Dockerfile>.dockerignore", resolved against the
# build context root). The build context is the monorepo root (see
# Dockerfile's header comment), so this keeps that context down to source
# only — every workspace's resolved node_modules, build output, and local
# state stay out.
**/node_modules
.git
.turbo
.nx
.alchemy
**/dist
**/build
**/.next
**/coverage
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
**/*.log
.DS_Store
tmp
temp
.cache
.vscode
.idea
